    "axis": "clarity",
    "evidence": "The headline, signed-intent versus paid-cart mismatch, and side-by-side LEGACY ALLOW / INTENT INTEGRITY BLOCK make the core claim understandable without narration across all viewports. However, the requested action is not self-evident: “Select any cached transaction” is explanatory copy, while rows lack an obvious interactive affordance or selected-state cue, and the header play icon is unlabeled. “Inspect the causal seam” reads like a secondary action but is visually embedded in the result panel. Mobile further weakens comprehension with very small metadata and evidence text.",
